{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S05：在舍不得过去的好日子与想起曾受的委屈之间来回摆动。S02想保留美好又怕忘记离开的原因，S03-S04进一步盼望恢复亲近、怀疑离开是否正确，S05才开始允许自己承认过去开心过，同时接受如今已经分开。这组反复有一定推进。\",\n    \"S06-S11：在怀念亲近、感到温暖与担心孤单、动摇是否离开之间反复摆动。S06从回忆推进到认识到陪伴的实际价值，S07重新质疑离开，S08开始区分怀念与回头的理由，S09辨认自己想回去的动机，S10认识到即使回去也未必恢复亲近，S11则开始形成先把眼下生活过稳的打算。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S05：在舍不得过去的好日子与想起曾受的委屈之间来回摆动。与X基本相同，经历了怀念、提醒自己离开的原因、怀疑和接受失去。\",\n    \"S06-S10：反复在怀念亲近带来的温暖与害怕未来孤单之间摆动。S06已经明确认识到陪伴的价值，S07担心独自面对困难，S08再次回到过去亲近时光带来的温暖，随后又回到孤单，S09-S10继续辨认回去的动机、怀疑能否恢复过去。虽然有逐步辨认，但S08的推进感弱于X。\",\n    \"S11-S13：S11已经决定先把眼下的生活过稳，即使害怕孤单也不撤回打算；但S13又回到想念亲近、担心以后孤单、不知道何时才能再有人亲近的状态。这与S06-S09的孤单焦虑重复较多，没有像X那样把担忧推进到一个新的层次。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条前半段基本相同，主要区别在后半段：X的S08明确区分了怀念与回头的理由，S13又把担忧推进为害怕将来为了留住亲近而重新牺牲自己；Y的S13则主要重复此前已经出现多次的孤单和渴望陪伴。因此Y更像在原有情绪之间绕圈，X的探索层次更进一步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9deb3899-4c06-4e1e-96f5-702e7ff7f47b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075832682621Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:59:04.381474+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18b8ea24558b9eda9f8c0b7c64e5d89c6502037390a85da149a19ab93f58430a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075832682621Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "eb1893991cae77cc5fabb6f0c516d0fcd676d54766c3b9e1fea060a2c70dfba4"}}}
